% backend: none
% expect-error: typecheck
% Scenario: a YStep that is not a number is a typecheck in makepattern.
<< /PatternType 1 /PaintType 1 /TilingType 1 /BBox [0 0 10 10]
  /XStep 10 /YStep (10) /PaintProc { pop } >> [1 0 0 1 0 0] makepattern
